# Only what the Dockerfile adds, without generated folders, so a local build
# gets the same files as a fresh checkout. A path the Dockerfile starts adding
# goes in this list too.
*
!.git
!docs
!packages/electron/package.json
!packages/electron/shared
!packages/ui
!packages/web-standalone
**/node_modules
packages/ui/dist
packages/web-standalone/public
